1
00:00:00,398 --> 00:00:02,228
(Leonard:)I'm glad you had a
nice time with Amy.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,370
(Sheldon:)Me, too. It's comforting to know

3
00:00:04,435 --> 00:00:06,975
(Sheldon:)that she and I are able
to function as friends.

4
00:00:07,038 --> 00:00:09,308
(Penny:)Well, I've never been
friends with any of my exes.

5
00:00:09,374 --> 00:00:12,214
(Sheldon:)Oh, I'm sure you and Leonard
will be able to pull it off.

6
00:00:12,276 --> 00:00:14,946
(Sheldon:)(phone rings)

7
00:00:15,013 --> 00:00:18,353
(Sheldon:)Oh. It's my friend Amy.

8
00:00:18,416 --> 00:00:19,916
(Sheldon:)Hello.

9
00:00:19,984 --> 00:00:21,054
(Amy(on skype):)Hi, Sheldon.

10
00:00:21,119 --> 00:00:22,549
(Amy:)I'm just driving home
from my mother's.

11
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:24,490
(Sheldon:)Did you have a nice time?

12
00:00:24,555 --> 00:00:26,895
(Amy:)I did. Um...

13
00:00:26,958 --> 00:00:31,628
(Amy:)listen, I really enjoyed
spending this morning with you.

14
00:00:31,696 --> 00:00:33,626
(Sheldon:)Well, I can't take
all the credit.

15
00:00:33,698 --> 00:00:35,628
(Sheldon:)It was pretty funny
when that one anchovy

16
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:38,640
(Sheldon:)started going the wrong way.
(chuckles)

17
00:00:38,703 --> 00:00:41,103
(chuckles)
It was.

18
00:00:41,172 --> 00:00:43,642
(Amy:)Uh, listen,

19
00:00:43,708 --> 00:00:46,408
I-I was thinking that, um,

20
00:00:46,477 --> 00:00:50,877
(Amy:)maybe I'm ready
to be your girlfriend again.

21
00:00:50,948 --> 00:00:53,388
(Howard:)Oh.

22
00:00:53,451 --> 00:00:56,221
(Sheldon:)I thought we were just friends.

23
00:00:56,287 --> 00:00:57,357
(Bernadette:)We are.

24
00:00:57,422 --> 00:01:00,022
(Amy:)But I was hoping,

25
00:01:00,091 --> 00:01:01,991
(Amy:)maybe...
Amy,

26
00:01:02,060 --> 00:01:03,790
(Sheldon:)I excel at many things,

27
00:01:03,861 --> 00:01:06,731
(Sheldon:)but getting over you
wasn't one of them.

28
00:01:07,999 --> 00:01:11,639
(Sheldon:)I think I need
to just be your friend.

29
00:01:12,470 --> 00:01:14,970
(Amy:)Okay.

30
00:01:15,039 --> 00:01:16,969
(Amy:)I understand.

31
00:01:17,041 --> 00:01:18,971
(shuddering breath)

32
00:01:19,043 --> 00:01:20,513
(Sheldon:)Good.

33
00:01:20,578 --> 00:01:21,808
(Sheldon:)Oh, I watched a video

34
00:01:21,879 --> 00:01:23,819
(Sheldon:)of the hagfish producing mucus,

35
00:01:23,881 --> 00:01:27,451
(Sheldon:)so I'm gonna change my answer
and eat SpongeBob.

36
00:01:27,518 --> 00:01:29,718
(Amy:)Okay. Sure.

